":"https://api.github.com/users/mtakahar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mtakahar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-04-02T01:45:39Z","assignee":{"login":"timothy-e","id":26841748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e","html_url":"https://github.com/timothy-e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":12325545287,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOBlCVUc6ESWwxzwAAAALeqOVH","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/12325545287","actor":{"login":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte-ci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-04-02T13:00:33Z","label":{"name":"status/awaiting-triage","color":"E33F0D"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2032131410","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/21771#issuecomment-2032131410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/21771","id":2032131410,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc55H91S","user":{"login":"timothy-e","id":26841748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e","html_url":"https://github.com/timothy-e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-04-02T14:02:24Z","updated_at":"2024-04-02T14:02:24Z","body":"> Similar plan on the vanilla PG15.6 shows a recheck condition that is missing in the YB plan (that is not necessarily the source of the problem though): Recheck Cond: ((col_int_key >= 8) OR ((col_varchar_key)::text < 'w'::text) OR (((col_varchar_key)::text < 'h'::text) AND ((col_varchar_key)::text = ANY ('{j,x}'::text[])))).\r\n\r\nPG always displays the recheck. Since PG does not print `Rows removed by recheck` in this plan, we know that PG didn't remove rows by recheck here. \r\n\r\n```sql\r\npostgres# explain (analyze, costs off)  SELECT * FROM t1 WHERE t1.col_varchar_key < 'h' AND col_varchar_key IN ('j', 'x');\r\n                                                    QUERY PLAN\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Bitmap Heap Scan on t1 (actual time=0.029..0.032 rows=0 loops=1)\r\n   Recheck Cond: (((col_varchar_key)::text < 'h'::text) AND ((col_varchar_key)::text = ANY ('{j,x}'::text[])))\r\n   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on t1_col_varchar_key_col_int_key_idx (actual time=0.012..0.013 rows=0 loops=1)\r\n         Index Cond: (((col_varchar_key)::text < 'h'::text) AND ((col_varchar_key)::text = ANY ('{j,x}'::text[])))\r\n Planning Time: 1.401 ms\r\n Execution Time: 0.290 ms\r\n(6 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe problem is that bitmap scan doesn't identify the second index condition as requiring recheck, but Index Scan does. \r\n\r\n```sql\r\nyugabyte# explain (analyze, costs off) /*+ IndexScan(t1) */\r\nSELECT * FROM t1 WHERE t1.col_varchar_key < 'h' AND col_varchar_key IN ('j', 'x');\r\n                                                 QUERY PLAN\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Index Scan using t1_col_varchar_key_col_int_key_idx on t1 (actual time=2.106..2.106 rows=0 loops=1)\r\n   Index Cond: (((col_varchar_key)::text < 'h'::text) AND ((col_varchar_key)::text = ANY ('{j,x}'::text[])))\r\n Planning Time: 0.375 ms\r\n Execution Time: 2.179 ms\r\n Peak Memory Usage: 24 kB\r\n(5 rows)\r\n\r\nyugabyte# explain (analyze, costs off) /*+ BitmapScan(t1) */\r\nSELECT * FROM t1 WHERE t1.col_varchar_key < 'h' AND col_varchar_key IN ('j', 'x');\r\n                                                    QUERY PLAN\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n YB Bitmap Table Scan on t1 (actual time=1.804..1.806 rows=3 loops=1)\r\n   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on t1_col_varchar_key_col_int_key_idx (actual time=1.190..1.190 rows=3 loops=1)\r\n         Index Cond: (((col_varchar_key)::text < 'h'::text) AND ((col_varchar_key)::text = ANY ('{j,x}'::text[])))\r\n Planning Time: 0.331 ms\r\n Execution Time: 1.935 ms\r\n Peak Memory Usage: 44 kB\r\n(6 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nBitmap Scans use `YbPredetermineNeedsRecheck` to determine if the second index condition needs to be rechecked or not.  D33675 / 9ac2a5d805f9f40cee17a299e4bb7b4a429a4c34 fixed an issue with `YbGetOrdinaryColumnsNeedingPgRecheck`, but it's not the same issue. I'll continue to investigate. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2032131410/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"timothy-e","id":26841748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e","html_url":"https://github.com/timothy-e","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothy-e/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoth